  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For required circle, $P(1,8)$ and $O(3,2)$ will be the end point of its diameter.\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\therefore(x-1)(x-3)+(y-8)(y-2)=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\quad x^2+y^2-4 x-10 y+19=0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
